  "label": "Passive Resignation Concept",
  "description": "The meme conveys the concept of passive resignation — a state of giving up or deciding not to act further, often humorously. This concept is rooted in social behavior and communication, where people use humor to express frustration or a desire to disengage from a situation. The child’s expression and posture are used as an analogical representation of this human behavior.",
